    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "what do u mean \"let go of the pressure\"? i just feel like i'm constantly making things worse. it's like every time i try to be what they need, i just fail harder. it's not even about me anymore, it's about the fact that they'd be so much better off if i just wasn't such a disaster for them.",
